{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by simple and snappy Flash games, <strong>Salt VS Pepper</strong> is an twin-stick shooter that makes you say<i> just one more try</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a silly little guy while shifting between black and white, spawning an evil clone every time you shift. But  be careful, the clone has everything YOU have...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with many guns, weapons and items<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/17a62757cb1cd7e58d689c37f51b2e60.poster.avif?t=1761173504\" aria-label=\"a list of some of the items from the game\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/17a62757cb1cd7e58d689c37f51b2e60.webm?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/17a62757cb1cd7e58d689c37f51b2e60.mp4?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who needs bullets when you can have both bullets<strong>\u00a0AND</strong>\u00a0walls! Try lots of different &quot;weapons&quot;, with more on the way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill them with style!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/0d07358abc1a9c2b608f9b7a4b9f0d6a.poster.avif?t=1761173504\" aria-label=\"gameplay highlights \" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/0d07358abc1a9c2b608f9b7a4b9f0d6a.webm?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/0d07358abc1a9c2b608f9b7a4b9f0d6a.mp4?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative! Or, just embrace the chaos and let them blow themselves up... or die trying</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your friends!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.poster.avif?t=1761173504\" aria-label=\"gameplay footage with 4 players\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.webm?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.mp4?t=1761173504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play co-op with up to 4 players! Try to survive while you<i> almost</i>\u00a0have no idea what's going on.<i> Almost</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: The real winner is <strong>not</strong> friendship.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All current features will be included in the upcoming demo as well. Enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928310?t=1761173504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928310?t=1761173504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/8e9e4f8d8d79da47f42712b3daec785e7616afba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761173504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/8e9e4f8d8d79da47f42712b3daec785e7616afba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761173504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39